sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as NoahsArk Console
  participant API as Task API
  participant CMD as Command Facade
  participant WF as Workflow
  participant KB as Knowledge Retrieval
  participant EV as Event Log
  User->>UI: 提交需求、项目、设备与风险级别
  UI->>API: POST /api/noahsark/v2/tasks
  API->>CMD: create_task(intent, idempotency_key)
  CMD->>WF: 校验并创建任务
  WF-->>CMD: task_id / phase=intake
  CMD->>KB: retrieve(project, device_class, text)
  KB-->>CMD: retrieval_packet + citations
  alt 命中相似任务
    KB-->>CMD: reuse_blocks + differences + warnings
  else 无历史
    KB-->>CMD: no_history
  end
  CMD->>WF: 绑定检索快照
  CMD->>EV: append task.created / task.retrieved
  EV-->>UI: SSE task.created
  UI-->>User: 返回任务详情与证据来源
  Note over CMD,KB: 检索结果是不可信证据；没有命中必须显式 no_history
